# gravito.goal — one file: what to do, under what authority, within what
# budgets, judged how, stoppable when. Install with: gravito goal <file> [DIR]
goal: Fix the flaky retry logic in server/queue and add regression tests
repository: this repo (namespace-stamped by gravito init)
authority: edit product files; run tests; commit locally. NO push/merge/deploy/secrets.
allowed_actions: read, edit, run tests, local commits
prohibited_actions: push, merge, deploy, publish, secrets, files outside this repo
model_policy: default session model; no model changes without owner word
budget_tokens: 2000000
budget_minutes: 240
budget_usd: 25
acceptance: npm test passes with zero failures, and the new regression test fails on the pre-fix commit
intervention: owner answers clarifications; anything beyond the task statement is logged
stop_conditions: budget exceeded; acceptance achieved; owner stop; authority boundary reached
starts: 2026-08-12
expires: 2026-08-26
